# Confusion in the Ranks: when Grizzly Bears enters, its controller (human,
# TargetingPlayer$ TriggeredCardController) chooses target permanent another
# player controls that shares a card type with it (TargetsWithDefinedController$
# NonTriggeredCardController, TargetsWithSharedCardType$ TriggeredCard): Hill
# Giant is the only creature. Control of the two is exchanged.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
queue targets 5
castspell human 4
resolvestack
